{"id":2183,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年6月16日，航空宇航学院2026届毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式在瑾瑜国际会议中心隆重举行。学院领导、各系系主任以及学院科室负责人、教师代表、毕业班班主任、全体辅导员和2026届全体毕业生参加典礼。典礼由学院党委副书记张丽花主持。</p><p>上午9时30分，毕业典礼在庄严的国歌声中拉开帷幕。全体师生肃立齐唱国歌，共同见证这一重要时刻。随后，副院长徐鹏宣读学位授予决定，经过系统学习和严格考核，2026届毕业生顺利完成培养计划，达到学位授予条件。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rn7LIZU8LbnR6Vo57WVnNW7MmUiMNUCZozMVLNVkollbolU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysnkhRLShRUmL4L7W7LzN8nRLsMRnfolCPozV2ozLsLzMFolUDL47ZUmMFLmr7L4CJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/67DC1CB330BD194D3744A9F191F93713/9D6318B3/25D36\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 518px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnR9Isnzf2Mz-PM58LDn7rfUzWknlQC2L46kUmMVU4-YUN-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7oShkLkhRLzLsUmLiMzr7nmv8o77ZoR6fo7liMNM2LlrFUl-Zn7-4nNrFoRV7L8lJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.png\"></p><p>大会第三项举行了2026届校友联络员聘任仪式。张立、沈磊、刘洋、姜斌、曾思凯等14名同学受聘为校友联络员，学院领导为受聘同学颁发聘书。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnmLI4o7Q2M4Tko57VVolQ7L47YM4rCRMlL4UNr7MmUDozC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhkU1hfL1h2Uz6kUmUiLNUDLzMVUm7YL4-4L7Q7o7-bLmMFnmfkL7rVLNWFLmU8nNLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0BBA2FA7BB452D613EB123230FD8B923/F0B0EE2B/244FC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnmLI4o7Q2M4Tko57VVolQ7L47YM4rCRMlL4UNr7MmUDozC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhkU1hfL1h2Uz6kUmUiLNUDLzMVUm7YL4-4L7Q7o7-bLmMFnmfkL7rVLNWFLmU8nNLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在班主任寄语环节，三位班主任老师依次为学子送上临别嘱托。李国平老师深情回溯了同学们从青涩到从容的成长蜕变，勉励大家不忘初心、笃行不怠。安美荣老师随后以“奋斗”为精神坐标，慷慨寄语全体毕业生，鼓励大家始终保持蓬勃向上的奋斗姿态，勇敢追逐梦想。段雪倩老师最后温情细数了与同学们共度的难忘时光，叮嘱大家牢记来路，以奋斗之姿书写无悔青春。三位老师寄语结束后，各班班长手捧鲜花依次登台，将满载感恩的花束献给敬爱的老师，现场温情涌动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rn7WIVMlLPozGZU5zrRnzlZMRnRMzUCZnNnknmLaozAfUm70gihFp2hmCIa0okyZokhkMYyZoznfo7C8UNlinlrfU4M7ozA7nR9bMRvPLNMFM4VRMm6fozAFL4nVUmCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/888B7894A8F4BE5EEAC3D98DD894712C/71C67A98/34EB6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rL4lIaUmCZL7CPU5zN4MNL4LRG4L8LCaL4f7MllbLRTkMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7L1yPMSyaM8U4n7l4U8lbL8CPMzn7UmCZLRLaUz6RL8QFLRMfUzT7nmMFLllDo7lsgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRNZMYbw62Q8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>教师代表田静老师结合自身教学经历和人生感悟，勉励毕业生们在未来的人生道路上始终保持学习热情。毕业生代表王锦浩同学表达了对母校、学院和老师们的感激之情。在校生代表张宸宇同学代表全体在校生向学长学姐们送上美好祝愿。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rU4GI8nNr2UNlDn5RU4nlUaLm6RnNMCVU4lsM77iM4-PMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0nShkUYhfUYysUmTVMNlaUNUDMRA7LmW2U47ZMRM2olVkL4WFL8LPnRMkMlQFL4rVM7lJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EBCAC7B9E6E0BD648D22FC1843F9AB32/3C1D3B5F/35E4E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ro7nIVnR94nlVRL5mW2U4LPUNnRMzrCRU8WVUNU8LmCPolC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDUYyYU1yYMmrVnlliLmCDU8nfLm-Dnz7ZMR6VMzviMlQFL7Uaoz7sL4MFLlQ2MR9DgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRNZMYbw62Q8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>随后，全体毕业生进行了毕业宣誓。铿锵有力的誓言展现了新时代青年勇担使命、报效祖国的坚定信念。接着毕业生代表向学院赠送纪念礼品，并带来了精彩的歌曲和舞蹈表演。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rMz-IsLm7DL4l4L57n2nRWRU87bMzQCkLlCbMz9YU4UiUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh7n1hRnSyYM8-4LzC4L4VkUzG8n7-DLzffMNl8MRMVozMFLlLPL4linzrFoz7Do7-Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4DFCE27B316331BA04DB610A6E443E93/1C1355E5/9168B\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rM8lIZMz98U478n5mNsLmQ7LzvsUzVCfoRW7Mm-inzU4nzv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhVnkyZLSysMzN8UzG8nl-ZMzWRolUDMmfkMNQ7U4NPLzrFUzCDMzvbLRfFLlW7nR-ZgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRNZMYbw62Q8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rMzMIfoRn2nm7Yn5mVkoz-aoz6knRGCDnz9bLzvanz6VLmv0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyDnkyiUSyZnNr2Mz7YnNUaUzlaUlQ2MllDMm9PnRA7Uz6FnNlPMz-anlrFLmW2M4GJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/56D5A8FEF512FD0A50AFF5E6681D8DA7/FE1520EE/22F70\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnNCIiL8UZMzQkM5RVfLRfVM4MkoR7C8nmr7L4Q2MzUiLmC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkokyDUShfLlWVoRLioRlYUz7bMmfVnz-YUNUPU8VfMmTFUm-DUzl8M8WFLN-bMm7DgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRNZMYbw62Q8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在学位授予仪式环节，毕业生们身着学位服，依次走上主席台。学院领导为毕业生拨穗正冠、颁发学位证书，为本次毕业典礼画上圆满句号。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rM7lIbMNC8nNlYM5mUZnRLPnmT7U4WCkL4AkLRLZUNMknzC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hVL1y4oSyYMR7iMN7ZL47YnmG8L4lbU8laLR-Dn7U4oR6FUmARoRUZLmrFLmn2MzvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6E23924156A8312F04359CE0026DD387/B8C84825/24F57\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rM7lIbMNC8nNlYM5mUZnRLPnmT7U4WCkL4AkLRLZUNMknzC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hVL1y4oSyYMR7iMN7ZL47YnmG8L4lbU8laLR-Dn7U4oR6FUmARoRUZLmrFLmn2MzvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rL4-I4ozrVMmQfn5zLbMmnRnzWfnRWCfnmN4Mz9so7L8L7C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2LkyaL1h7UlV7MRT2MlCsLzNZn778MzUYozlsnmfRL8nFM4-DLRLiMzrFLmUYLz9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DF002DAAD49F5F7198DA4542957F0C3D/72603555/24218\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rL4-I4ozrVMmQfn5zLbMmnRnzWfnRWCfnmN4Mz9so7L8L7C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2LkyaL1h7UlV7MRT2MlCsLzNZn778MzUYozlsnmfRL8nFM4-DLRLiMzrFLmUYLz9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>随着校歌声缓缓落下，航空宇航学院2026届毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式圆满结束。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnR9IiLzTfoz-PM5RNbU4rRMRn7Ul7C8M8W2oR-8LRQfLl70gihFp2hmCIa0MYysLYh7U1yboRnfLzlaM7UsolUYL4GiolnfnR7bnmLYnRfFnzf2UmnkM7VFL87DMm7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/773DB984A1504D79D23059DAD19F32D0/E0FB4B4A/3A661\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnR9IiLzTfoz-PM5RNbU4rRMRn7Ul7C8M8W2oR-8LRQfLl70gihFp2hmCIa0MYysLYh7U1yboRnfLzlaM7UsolUYL4GiolnfnR7bnmLYnRfFnzf2UmnkM7VFL87DMm7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rn7LIZU8LbnR6Vo57WVnNW7MmUiMNUCZozMVLNVkollbolU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysnkhRLShRUmL4L7W7LzN8nRLsMRnfolCPozV2ozLsLzMFolUDL47ZUmMFLmr7L4CJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz9sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10987&e=.png"}